hadiths[73]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha jab Asr ki namaz ka waqt hua. Phir logon ne wuzu talash kiya aur use na paya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas wuzu laya gaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us bartan mein apna hath rakha. Aur logon ko hukm diya ke us mein se wuzu karein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne pani ko Aap ki ungliyon ke neeche se ubalte dekha, yahan tak ke un mein se aakhri ne wuzu kiya."
"1469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Tabuk ki ladayi ladi. Phir jab Aap Wadi al-Qura aaye to ek aurat apne bagh mein thi. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne sahaba se farmaya: Andaza karo. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dus wasaq andaza lagaya. Phir us se farmaya: Gino jo us mein se nikle. Phir jab hum Tabuk aaye to Aap ne farmaya: Suno! Aaj raat sakht hawa chalegi. Phir koi khada na ho. Aur jo oont ke sath ho wo use bandhe. Phir hum ne unhe bandha. Aur sakht hawa chali. Phir ek shakhs khada hua. Phir usے Tayy ke pahad par phenka. Aur Ayla ke badshah ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko safed khachchar hadiya kiya. Aur Aap ko chadar pehnayi. Aur us ke samandar ke liye likha. Phir jab Aap Wadi al-Qura aaye to aurat se farmaya: Tumhara bagh kitna laya? Us ne kaha: Dus wasaq, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke andaze par. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Madina ki taraf jaldi karne wala hun. Phir tum mein se jo mere sath jaldi karna chahe wo jaldi kare. Phir jab Aap Madina par chadhe to farmaya: Ye Tabah hai. Phir jab Uhud dekha to farmaya: Ye chhota pahad hai jo hum se mohabbat karta hai aur hum us se mohabbat karte hain. Kya main tumhe Ansar ke gharon mein se behtar ghar ki khabar na dun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Bani Najjar ke ghar, phir Bani Abd al-Ashhal ke ghar, phir Bani Sa'ida ke ghar, ya Bani Harith bin al-Khazraj ke ghar. Aur Ansar ke har gharon mein, matlab bhalayi."
"1470","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Najd ki ladayi ladi. Phir jab Aap ko dopahar ne pa liya jabke Wo ghane bawalon wali wadi mein they, to Aap darakht ke neeche utre aur us se saya liya. Aur apni talwar latkayi. Phir log darakhton mein muntashir ho gaye taake saya lein. Aur jab hum aise they to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bulaya. Phir hum aaye. Phir dehati Aap ke samne baitha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye mere paas aaya jabke main soya tha. Phir us ne meri talwar khench li. Phir main bedar hua jabke wo mere sar par khada tha, khinchi hui saaf. Us ne kaha: Tumhe mujh se kaun bachayega? Main ne kaha: Allah. Phir us ne use myan mein kiya. Phir baitha. Phir wo hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use saza na di."
"1471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo hidayat aur ilm lekar Allah ne mujhe bheja us ki misal zyada barish jaisi hai jo zameen ko lagi. Phir us mein se saaf thi jis ne pani qubool kiya. Phir bahut si ghaas aur sabza ugaya. Aur us mein se sakht thi jis ne pani rok liya. Phir Allah ne us se logon ko faida diya. Phir unhon ne piya, pilaya aur boya. Aur us mein se doosre giroh ko lagi, wo to chatyal maidan hain jo pani nahi rokte, na ghaas ugate. Phir ye us ki misal hai jo Allah ke deen mein samajh rakhe aur use faida de jo Allah ne mujhe dekar bheja. Phir us ne ilm hasil kiya aur sikhaya. Aur us ki misal jis ne is se sar na uthaya aur Allah ki hidayat ko qubool na kiya jo dekar main bheja gaya hun."
"1472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak meri aur logon ki misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne aag jalayi. Phir jab us ne apne ird-gird roshan kiya to patange aur ye janwar jo aag mein padte hain us mein padne lage. Phir wo unhe rokne laga aur wo us par ghalib aaye. Phir wo us mein ghusne lage. Phir main tumhari kamar pakad kar tumhe Aag se rokta hun jabke wo us mein ghuste hain."
"1473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak meri aur mujh se pehle Ambiya ki misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne ghar banaya. Phir use acha aur haseen banaya, siwaye kone mein eent ki jagah ke. Phir log us ka tawaf karne lage. Aur us par ta'ajjub karte. Aur kehte: Kash ye eent rakhi hoti? Phir main eent hun. Aur main Khatim al-Nabiyyin hun."
"1474","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur Ambiya ki misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne ghar banaya. Phir use mukammal aur haseen banaya, siwaye eent ki jagah ke. Phir log us mein dakhil hone lage aur ta'ajjub karte. Aur kehte: Kash eent ki jagah?"
"1475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Main Hauz par tum se aage hun."
"1476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Hauz par tum se aage hun. Jo mere paas se guzre wo piye. Aur jo piye wo kabhi pyasa nahi hoga. Mere paas qaumein aayengi jinhe main pehchanta hun aur wo mujhe pehchante hain. Phir mere aur un ke darmiyan rok bana di jayegi."
"1477","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo izafa karte hain: Phir main kahunga: Beshak wo mujh se hain. Phir kaha jayega: Beshak tum nahi jante jo unhon ne tumhare baad nikala. Phir main kahunga: Doori, doori us ke liye jo mere baad badle."
"1478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mera Hauz mahine ki musafat hai. Us ka pani doodh se zyada safed hai. Us ki khushboo mushk se zyada umda hai. Us ke pyale aasman ke sitaron jaisa hain. Jo us mein se piye wo kabhi pyasa nahi hoga."
"1479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Hauz par hun yahan tak ke dekhun ke tum mein se kaun mere paas aata hai. Aur mujh se pehle log pakde jayenge. Phir main kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Mujh se aur meri ummat se. Phir kaha jayega: Kya tumhe maloom hai jo unhon ne tumhare baad kiya? Allah ki qasam! Wo barabar apni ediyon par laut-te rahe. Phir Ibn Abi Mulaika [is hadith ke Asma se rawi] kehte they: Ae Allah! Beshak hum Teri panah mangte hain ke hum apni ediyon par lautein ya apne deen se aazmaye jayein."
"1480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Uhud ke shaheedon par aath saal baad namaz parhi, zindon aur murdon ko alwida kehne wale ki tarah. Phir mimbar par chadhe. Phir farmaya: Beshak main tum se aage hun. Aur main tum par gawah hun. Aur beshak tumhara wada Hauz hai. Aur beshak main use apne is maqam se dekhta hun. Aur beshak main tum par shirk ka dar nahi rakhta. Lekin main tum par duniya ka darta hun ke tum us mein muqabla karo."
"1481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main Hauz par tum se aage hun. Aur tum mein se mard uthaye jayenge, phir mujh se pehle chheen liye jayenge. Phir main kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Mere sahaba? Phir kaha jayega: Beshak tum nahi jante jo unhon ne tumhare baad nikala."
"1482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Haritha bin Wahb (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Hauz ka zikr karte suna. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jitna Madina aur Sana ke darmiyan hai."
"1483","[AI-translation] Mustaurid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne us se kaha: Kya tum ne use bartanon ke bare mein nahi suna? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Mustaurid ne kaha: Us mein bartan sitaron jaisa dekhe jate hain."
"1484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare samne Hauz hai jitna Jarba aur Adhruh ke darmiyan hai."
"1485","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Main mardon ko apne Hauz se zaroor rokunga, jaise ajnabi oont Hauz se roka jata hai."
"1486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mere Hauz ka andaza jitna Ayla aur Sana Yemen ke darmiyan hai. Aur beshak us mein surahiyan aasman ke sitaron ki ginti jaisi hain."
"1487","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mere paas mere sahaba mein se log Hauz aayenge yahan tak ke main ne unhe pehchana. Wo mujh se pehle chheen liye jayenge. Phir main kahunga: Mere sahaba? Phir Wo farmayega: Tum nahi jante jo unhon ne tumhare baad nikala."
"1488","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Uhud ke din dekha, jabke Aap ke sath do mard Aap ki taraf se lad rahe they, un par safed kapde they, sab se sakht ladayi jaisa. Main ne unhe pehle na dekha na baad mein."
"1489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein sab se haseen aur bahadur they. Aur Madina wale ek raat dare. Phir wo awaz ki taraf nikle. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka istiqbal kiya jabke Aap khabar le chuke they, jabke Wo Abu Talha ke nange ghode par they, Aap ki gardan mein talwar thi. Jabke Wo farma rahe they: Daro nahi, daro nahi. Phir farmaya: Hum ne use samandar paya. Ya farmaya: Beshak wo samandar hai."
"1490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein sab se sakhi they. Aur sab se zyada sakhi Ramazan mein hote jab Jibreel Aap se milte. Aur Wo Ramazan ki har raat Aap se milte aur Aap se Quran ka daur karte. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhalayi mein bheji hui hawa se zyada sakhi hain."
"1491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dus saal khidmat ki. Phir Aap ne mujh se uff na kaha, na kyun kiya, na kyun na kiya."
"1492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye to Abu Talha ne mera hath pakda. Phir mujhe lekar Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas chale. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Anas samajhdar ladka hai. Phir Wo tumhari khidmat kare. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Aap ki hazar aur safar mein khidmat ki. Allah ki qasam! Aap ne mujh se kisi cheez ke bare mein jo main ne ki nahi farmaya: Tum ne ye aise kyun kiya? Na kisi cheez ke bare mein jo main ne na ki: Tum ne ye aise kyun na kiya?"
"1493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kabhi kisi cheez ka sawal nahi kiya gaya aur Aap ne farmaya: Nahi."
"1494","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kash Bahrain ka maal aaye to main ne tumhe aise aur aise aur aise diya hota. Phir Bahrain ka maal na aaya yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) faut ho gaye. Phir jab Bahrain ka maal aaya to Abu Bakr ne hukm diya. Phir pukara: Jis ka Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas wada ya qarz ho wo hamare paas aaye. Phir main Aap ke paas aaya. Phir main ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aisa aur aisa. Phir unhon ne mere liye lap bhari. Phir main ne use gina. Phir wo paanch sau thi. Aur farmaya: Is jaisa do lo."
"1495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Abu Saif Qain ke paas dakhil hue. Aur Wo Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke doodh-pilane wale they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ibrahim ko liya aur unhe bosa diya aur sungha. Phir is ke baad hum un ke paas dakhil hue jabke Ibrahim jaan de rahe they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dono aankhein behne lagein. Phir Abd al-Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) ne Aap se kaha: Aur tum Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Auf! Beshak wo rehem hai. Phir us ke peechhe doosri laye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak aankh roti hai, dil gham karta hai. Aur hum wahi kehte hain jo hamare Rab ko raazi kare. Aur beshak hum tumhari judayi se, ae Ibrahim! Ghamgeen hain."
"1496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Tum bachchon ko bosa dete ho? Hum unhe bosa nahi dete. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhare liye malik hun ke Allah ne tumhare dil se rehem chheen liya?"
"1497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hasan bin Ali ko bosa diya, jabke Aap ke paas Aqra bin Habis Tamimi baithe they. Phir Aqra ne kaha: Beshak mere dus bete hain, main ne un mein se kisi ko bosa nahi diya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha. Phir farmaya: Jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kiya jata."
"1498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kiya jata."
"1499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) parde mein kunwari se zyada haya wale they."
"1500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fahsh-go aur fahsh karne wale na they. Aur farmate they: Beshak tum mein behtar wo hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achhe hain."
"1501","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein they. Aur Aap ke sath Aap ka siyah ghulam tha jise Anjasha kaha jata hai, jo hanka deta tha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Tum par afsos ae Anjasha! Sheeshiyon se narmi se."
"1502","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko do mamalon ke darmiyan ikhtiyar nahi diya gaya magar Aap ne un dono mein aasan liya, jab tak gunah na ho. Phir agar gunah hota to Aap logon mein us se sab se door hote. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne liye badla nahi liya, magar Allah ki hurmat toti jaye to Allah ke liye badla lete."
"1503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne reshmi aur deebaj nahi chhua jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki hatheli se zyada narm ho. Aur main ne kabhi khushboo ya itr nahi sungha jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khushboo ya itr se zyada umda ho."
"1504","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umm Sulaim Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye chamde ka dastarkhwan bichhatin. Phir Aap us dastarkhwan par un ke paas dopahar aaram farmate. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sote to Wo Aap ke paseene aur baalon mein se leteen. Phir use sheeshi mein jama karteen. Phir use itr mein jama karteen."
"1505","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Harith bin Hisham (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tumhare paas wahi kaise aati hai? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kabhi mere paas ghanti ki awaz jaisi aati hai. Aur wo mujh par sab se sakht hai. Phir mujh se khol di jati hai jabke main ne us se jo kaha yaad kar liya hota hai. Aur kabhi farishta mere liye mard ki surat mein aata hai. Phir mujh se kalam karta hai. Phir main yaad karta hun jo wo kehta hai. Aisha ne kaha: Aur beshak main ne Aap ko dekha ke sakht sardi ke din Aap par wahi nazil hoti. Phir Aap se khol di jati jabke Aap ki peshani paseene se beh rahi hoti."
"1506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) darmiyane qad they, dono kandhon ke darmiyan kushada, Aap ke baal Aap ke kaan ki lau tak pahunchte. Main ne Aap ko surkh jode mein dekha. Main ne kabhi us se haseen cheez nahi dekhi."
"1507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein sab se haseen chehre wale they, sab se achhe akhlaq wale. Na lambe numayan, na chhote."
"1508","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baal ghungrale they, na seedhe na ghungrale sakht, Aap ke kaanon aur kandhon ke darmiyan."
"1509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baal Aap ke kandhon ko chhute they."
"1510","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Muhammad bin Sirin ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se poochha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khizab lagaya? Unhon ne kaha: Safedi thodi ke siwa nahi pahunchi."
"1511","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifa al-Suwai (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha. Aur main ne Aap ke neeche honth ke neeche safedi dekhi, anfaqah."
"1512","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha, jabke Hasan bin Ali (alaihimasalam) Aap se mushabeh they."
"1513","[AI-translation] Hazrat Saib bin Yazid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri khala mujhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le gayein. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera bhanja beemar hai. Phir Aap ne mera sar masah farmaya. Aur mere liye barkat ki dua farmayi. Phir wuzu farmaya. Phir main ne Aap ke wuzu se piya. Phir Aap ki peeth ke peechhe khada hua. Phir main ne Aap ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan nabuwwat ki mohar dekhi, kabootar ke ghonsle ki girah jaisi."
"1514","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka huliya bayan karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Wo qaum mein darmiyane qad they, na lambe na chhote. Roshan rang, na safed pheeka, na gandum-gon. Na ghungrale sakht, na seedhe narm. Aap par nazil hui jab Wo chalees saal ke they. Phir Makkah mein dus saal thehre jab Aap par nazil hoti rahi, Madina mein dus saal. Aur Aap ke sar aur dadhi mein bees safed baal na they."
"1515","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) faut hue jab Wo taintis saal ke they."
"1516","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makkah mein terah thehre. Aur wafat pa gaye jab Wo taintis saal ke they."
"1517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere paanch naam hain. Main Muhammad hun aur Ahmad hun. Aur main Mahi hun jis se Allah mere zariye kufr mitata hai. Aur main Hashir hun jis par log mere qadmon par jama kiye jayenge. Aur main Aqib hun."
"1518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne koi cheez banayi. Phir us mein ijazat di. Phir qaum us se bachi. Phir ye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahuncha. Phir Aap ne khutba diya. Phir Allah ki hamd ki. Phir farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai ke wo us cheez se bachte hain jo main karta hun? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main un mein Allah ko sab se zyada janta hun, Us se sab se zyada darne wala hun."
"1519","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin al-Zubair (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek mard ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Zubair se jhagda kiya, Harra ke nalo mein jis se wo khajooron ko pani dete. Phir Ansari ne kaha: Pani chhoro taake guzre. Phir us ne inkar kiya. Phir wo dono Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jhagadne aaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zubair se farmaya: Pani pilao ae Zubair! Phir apne padosi ki taraf pani bhejo. Phir Ansari ghazab-naak hua. Phir us ne kaha: Kya is liye ke wo tumhara phuphi-zaad hai? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra rang badal gaya. Phir farmaya: Pani pilao ae Zubair! Phir pani roko yahan tak ke mend ki taraf laute."
"1520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zubair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main gumaan karta hun ke ye ayat is mein nazil hui [phir tumhare Rab ki qasam! Wo iman nahi layenge yahan tak ke tumhe faisla banayein us mein jo un ke darmiyan jhagda ho]."
"1521","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Musalmanon mein jurm mein sab se bada wo hai jo aisi cheez ka sawal kare jo haram nahi hui. Phir wo us ke sawal ki wajah se haram hui."
"1522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khutba diya, jaisa main ne kabhi nahi suna. Unhon ne kaha: Agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ne apne chehre dhanpe, unhe rona tha. Phir ek shakhs ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Falan. Phir ye ayat nazil hui [aisi cheezon ka sawal na karo jo tumhe zahir hon to tumhe buri lagein]."
"1523","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sawal kiya yahan tak ke unhon ne Aap ko sawal se thaka diya. Phir Aap ghazab-naak hue. Phir mimbar par chadhe. Phir farmaya: Aaj mujh se kisi cheez ka sawal na karoge magar main tumhe bayan karunga. Phir main dayein aur bayein dekhne laga. Phir har shakhs apna sar kapde mein lapete rota tha. Phir ek shakhs tha jab wo mardon se jhagadta to usے us ke baap ke siwa pukara jata. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera baap kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Huzafa. Phir Umar khade hue. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hum Allah se Rab hone par raazi hue, Islam se deen hone par, Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Rasool hone par. Hum Allah se fitnon se panah mangte hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne bhalayi aur burayi mein aaj jaisa kabhi nahi dekha. Beshak mere liye Jannat aur Dozakh tasweer ki gayein yahan tak ke main ne unhe deewar ke peechhe dekha."
"1524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aisi cheezon ka sawal kiya gaya jinhe Aap na-pasand farmate. Phir jab Aap par zyada kiya gaya to Aap ghazab-naak hue. Phir logon se farmaya: Mujh se jo chaho poochho. Ek shakhs ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara baap Huzafa. Phir doosra khada hua. Phir us ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara baap Salim maula Shaiba. Phir jab Umar ne Aap ke chehre mein jo tha dekha to kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum Allah Azza wa Jalla ki taraf tauba karte hain."
"1525","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek par ek zamana zaroor aayega ke mujhe dekhna usے us ke ghar walon aur maal jaisa hone se zyada mehboob hoga."
"1526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Main Ibn Maryam se logon mein sab se zyada qareeb hun. Aur Ambiya allati bhai hain. Mere aur un ke darmiyan Nabi nahi."
"1527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Bani Adam mein koi bachcha paida nahi hota magar shaitan use chhuta hai jab paida hota hai. Phir wo shaitan ke chhune se cheekhta hua rota hai, siwaye Maryam aur un ke bete ke. Phir Abu Hurairah kehte [aur beshak main use aur us ki aulad ko Teri panah mein deti hun shaitan mardood se]."
"1528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Isa Ibn Maryam ne ek shakhs ko chori karte dekha. Phir us se farmaya: Kya tum ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Phir Isa ne kaha: Main Allah par iman laya aur apni aankh ko jhutlaya."
"1529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ne khatna karwaya jabke Wo assi saal ke they, qadum se."
"1530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum Ibrahim se zyada shak ke haq-dar hain jab unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe dikha ke Tu murdon ko kaise zinda karta hai? Farmaya: Kya tum iman nahi laye? Arz kiya: Kyun nahi, lekin taake mera dil mutma'in ho jaye. Aur Allah Lut par rehem farmaye. Beshak wo mazboot sahare ki panah lete they. Aur agar main qaid mein itna arsa rehta jitna Yusuf rahe to bulane wale ka jawab deta."
"1531","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ne teen jhoot ke siwa jhoot nahi bola. Un mein se do Allah Azza wa Jalla ki zaat mein: Aap ka qaul [beshak main beemar hun] aur Aap ka qaul [balke use un ke bade ne kiya hai]. Aur farmaya: Jab Wo ek din they aur Sara, jab Wo jabbaron mein se ek jabbar ke paas aaye to us se kaha gaya: Beshak yahan ek mard hai jis ke sath logon mein sab se haseen aurat hai. Phir us ne us ki taraf bheja. Phir us se us ke bare mein poochha. Phir us ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Meri behan. Phir Sara ke paas aaya. Us ne kaha: Ae Sara! Zameen ki peeth par mere aur tumhare siwa momin nahi hai. Aur beshak is ne mujh se poochha. Phir main ne use khabar di ke tum meri behan ho. Phir mujhe na jhutlana. Phir us ki taraf bheja. Phir jab wo us ke paas dakhil huein to wo apne hath se unhe pakadne laga. Phir pakda gaya. Phir us ne kaha: Mere liye Allah se dua karo. Aur main tumhe nuqsan nahi dunga. Phir unhon ne Allah se dua ki. Phir wo chhora gaya. Phir doosri martaba unhe pakda. Phir is jaisa ya us se sakht pakda gaya. Phir us ne kaha: Mere liye Allah se dua karo. Aur main tumhe nuqsan nahi dunga. Phir unhon ne dua ki. Phir wo chhora gaya. Phir apne kuchh darbanon ko bulaya. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak tum mere paas insan lekar nahi aaye. Tum to mere paas shaitan lekar aaye ho. Phir us ne unhe Hajira khidmat mein di. Phir wo un ke paas aayein jabke Wo namaz parh rahe they. Phir Aap ne apne hath se ishara farmaya: Kya haal hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ne kafir [ya fajir] ke fareb ko us ke seene mein lautaya. Aur Hajira khidmat mein di. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Wo tumhari maan hain ae Bani Ma as-Sama!"
"1532","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israil nange ghusl karte they, ek doosre ko dekhta tha. Aur Musa akele ghusl karte they. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa ko hamare sath ghusl karne se sirf ye rokta hai ke wo bad-wasa hain. Phir ek martaba wo ghusl karne gaye. Phir apna kapda pathar par rakha. Phir pathar un ke kapde ko lekar bhag gaya. Phir Musa us ke peechhe nikle kehte hue: Mera kapda, ae pathar! Yahan tak ke Bani Israil ne Musa ko dekha. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa mein koi aib nahi. Aur unhon ne apna kapda liya. Phir pathar ko marne lage. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak pathar par chhe ya saat maar se nishan hain, pathar par maar se."
"1533","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maut ka farishta Musa (alaihissalam) ki taraf bheja gaya. Phir jab wo un ke paas aaya to unhon ne use thappad mara. Phir wo apne Rab ki taraf lauta. Phir us ne kaha: Tune mujhe aise bande ki taraf bheja jo maut nahi chahta. Phir Allah ne us ki aankh usے lautayi. Aur farmaya: Laut ja. Phir us se kaho ke wo apna hath bail ki peeth par rakhe. Phir us ke liye har us se jo us ka hath dhanpe, har baal se saal hai. Us ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Phir kya? Farmaya: Phir maut. Us ne kaha: Phir ab. Phir Allah se sawal kiya ke use Muqaddas zameen se pathar phenkne ke fasle par qareeb kare. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir agar main wahan hota to tumhe us ki qabr raste ke kinare surkh teele ke paas dikhata."
"1534","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do mard gali dene lage, Musalmanon mein se ek mard, Yahood mein se ek mard. Musalman ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Muhammad ko jahano par muntakhab farmaya! To Yahoodi ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Musa ko jahano par muntakhab farmaya! Phir Musalman ne us waqt apna hath uthaya aur Yahoodi ka chehra thappad mara. Phir Yahoodi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya. Phir Aap ko us ke aur Musalman ke mamle ki khabar di. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Musalman ko bulaya. Phir us se is ke bare mein poochha. Phir us ne Aap ko khabar di. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe Musa par fazilat na do. Kyunke log Qayamat ke din behosh honge. Phir main un ke sath behosh hunga. Phir main sab se pehle hosh mein aaunga. Phir Musa Arsh ke pehlu ko pakde honge. Phir main nahi janta ke wo un mein they jo behosh hue aur mujh se pehle hosh mein aaye, ya un mein they jinhe Allah ne mustasna farmaya."
"1535","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe they to Yahoodi aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Abu al-Qasim! Tumhare sathiyon mein se ek mard ne mera chehra mara. Aap ne farmaya: Kaun? Us ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek mard. Aap ne farmaya: Use bulao. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne use mara? Us ne kaha: Main ne use bazar mein qasam khate suna: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Musa ko bashar par muntakhab farmaya! Main ne kaha: Ae khabees! Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par? Phir mujhe ghussa aaya aur main ne us ka chehra mara. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ambiya ke darmiyan fazilat na do. Kyunke log Qayamat ke din behosh honge. Phir main sab se pehle hunga jis se zameen phategi. Phir main Musa ko Arsh ke payon mein se ek paya pakde dekhunga. Phir main nahi janta ke wo un mein they jo behosh hue ya pehli behoshi se hisab liye gaye."
"1536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Banda ye na kahe ke main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun."
"1537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Banda ye na kahe ke main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun. Aur Aap ne unhe un ke walid ki taraf mansoob kiya."
"1538","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon mein sab se izzat wala kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein sab se parhezgar. To unhon ne kaha: Hum tum se is ke bare mein nahi poochhte. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Yusuf Nabiullah, Nabiullah ke bete, Nabiullah ke bete, Khalilullah ke bete. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tum se is ke bare mein nahi poochhte. Aap ne farmaya: Phir tum Arab ki kanon ke bare mein poochhte ho? Un mein jahiliyat mein behtar wo hain jo Islam mein behtar hain jab samjhein."
"1539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Musa Nabi Bani Israil mein khutba dene khade hue. Phir un se poochha gaya: Logon mein sab se zyada ilm wala kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main sab se zyada ilm wala hun. Phir Allah ne un par itab farmaya jab unhon ne ilm ko Us ki taraf na lautaya. Phir Allah ne un ki taraf wahi farmayi ke Majma al-Bahrain mein mere bandon mein se ek banda hai jo tum se zyada ilm wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Aur wo kaise? Phir un se kaha gaya: Tokri mein machhli uthao. Phir jab use kho do to wo wahan hai. Phir wo chale. Aur un ke ladke Yusha bin Nun ke sath chale. Aur tokri mein machhli uthayi. Yahan tak ke jab chattaan ke paas they to apne sar rakhe aur so gaye. Phir machhli tokri se nikal gayi. Phir samandar mein surang bana kar apna rasta liya. Aur Musa aur un ke ladke ke liye ta'ajjub tha. Phir baqi raat aur din chale. Phir jab subah hui to Musa ne apne ladke se kaha: Hamara subah ka khana lao. Beshak hum ne apne is safar mein thakan payi hai. Aur Musa ne thakan ka ehsas na paya yahan tak ke us jagah se aage badh gaye jis ka unhe hukm diya gaya tha. Phir un ke ladke ne un se kaha: Batayiye jab hum chattaan ke paas thehre to beshak main machhli bhool gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Musa ne kaha: Yehi hai jo hum chahte they. Phir wo apne nishanon par qisse sunate laute. Phir jab chattaan pahunche to ek mard kapde mein lipta tha [ya kaha apne kapde mein lipta]. Phir Musa ne salam kiya. Phir Khizr ne kaha: Aur tumhari zameen mein salam kahan? Phir unhon ne kaha: Main Musa hun. Unhon ne kaha: Bani Israil ke Musa? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhari pairwi karun is par ke tum mujhe us mein se sikhayo jo tumhe hidayat se sikhaya gaya? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum mere sath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge, ae Musa! Beshak main Allah ke ilm mein se ek ilm par hun jo Us ne mujhe sikhaya hai jise tum nahi jante. Aur tum us ilm par ho jo Us ne tumhe sikhaya hai jise main nahi janta. Unhon ne kaha: Tum mujhe paoge agar Allah ne chaha sabir, aur main tumhare hukm ki na-farmani nahi karunga. Phir wo dono samandar ke kinare paidal chale, un ke paas kashti na thi. Phir un ke paas kashti guzri. Phir unhon ne un se kalam kiya ke wo unhe sawar karein. Phir Khizr ko pehchana gaya. Phir unhon ne unhe baghair kiraye sawar kiya. Phir chidiya aayi aur kashti ke kinare par baithi. Phir samandar mein ek ya do chonch marein. Phir Khizr ne kaha: Ae Musa! Mera ilm aur tumhara ilm Allah ke ilm mein se kam nahi hua magar is chidiya ki chonch jaisa samandar mein. Phir Khizr kashti ke takhton mein se ek takhte ki taraf gaye aur use ukhaad diya. Phir Musa ne kaha: Qaum ne hamein baghair kiraye sawar kiya. Tum un ki kashti ki taraf gaye aur use phaad diya taake us walon ko gharq karo? Unhon ne kaha: Kya main ne nahi kaha ke beshak tum mere sath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge? Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere bhoolne par na pakdo. Phir pehli Musa se bhool thi. Phir wo dono chale. Phir ladkon ke sath khelta hua ladka tha. Phir Khizr ne use us ke sar ke upar se pakda aur us ka sar apne hath se ukhaad diya. Phir Musa ne kaha: Kya tum ne paak jaan ko baghair jaan ke qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Kya main ne tum se nahi kaha ke beshak tum mere sath sabr ki taqat nahi rakhoge? Phir wo dono chale yahan tak ke jab basti walon ke paas aaye to un ke ghar walon se khana manga. Phir unhon ne un ki mehmaani se inkar kiya. Phir us mein deewar payi jo girne wali thi. Phir use khada kiya. Khizr ne apne hath se use khada kiya. Phir Musa ne un se kaha: Agar chahte to us par ujrat lete. Unhon ne kaha: Ye mere aur tumhare darmiyan judayi hai. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Musa par rehem farmaye. Kash wo sabr karte yahan tak ke hamein un dono ke mamle mein se qissa sunaya jata."
"1540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha jabke main ghaar mein tha: Agar un mein se ek apne qadmon ke neeche dekhe to hamein dekhega. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai ae Abu Bakr! Do ke bare mein jin ka teesra Allah hai?"
